</div><p>35.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"61\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 61.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 31.4 31.4 38.2 38.2\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 45.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o karyeden<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"53\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 53.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 30.0 30.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 36.8\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bir âyet bir nişane - ki hikâyesi veya harabesidir. </p>","y":0}